{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118236","id":3491419405,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7QGtUN","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118236","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118236.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118236.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118236","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118236/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118236/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118236/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9bafe29097cd89ea20b969151bf4362722975515","number":118236,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Make `JoltContactListener3D` lockless","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #118047 (together with #118227).\r\n\r\nThe goal of this PR is to remove any potential lock contention from the various callbacks in `JoltContactListener3D`, as called by Jolt itself from its threaded jobs during the simulation step, which should provide a significant speedup in certain cases, especially when dealing with many `Area3D`.\r\n\r\nThis achieves that by moving several of the collections found in `JoltContactListener3D` into a struct called `ThreadLocals`, which is lazily instantiated as a `thread_local` in `_get_thread_locals()`. These instances of `ThreadLocals` register themselves into a `static` list that we can then iterate over, allowing us to deal with the various collections largely the same way as before, except we now need to collect and process the data from all the threads in `post_step`, so there's a bit of extra work happening there, especially for soft bodies.\r\n\r\n---\r\n_Disclaimer: AI tooling was used during the planning of this change, as well as to review it, but all the code was written by me._","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_u